    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Idle Planets is a game where your objective is to extract the maximum amount of minerals in a galaxy with different planets, aiming to become the master of the universe.<br><br>Enhance your planets, automate extraction, and acquire upgrades to advance in mineral mining. Earn Galaxy points and Ascension points by resetting your progress to access permanent enhancements!<br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PRINCIPAL FEATURES</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 Unique Planets</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Planetary Automation</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 700 Upgrades</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Permanent Upgrades</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Random Events</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768260/extras/f8b1c04232d284027595b2334e674900.poster.avif?t=1723238010\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768260/extras/f8b1c04232d284027595b2334e674900.webm?t=1723238010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768260/extras/f8b1c04232d284027595b2334e674900.mp4?t=1723238010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST  NOW</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768260/extras/75590c43bb673625fbf24e5726615586.poster.avif?t=1723238010\" width=472 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768260/extras/75590c43bb673625fbf24e5726615586.webm?t=1723238010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2768260/extras/75